"Plural-Forms: nplurals=2; plural=(n > 1);\n"

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "A tall, statuesque corporate type with striking hair and cheekbones is staring at you, hands on her hips."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/14
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Something about her makes you instinctively crave her approval. And the way she's looking at you just now makes you doubtful whether or not you'll get it."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/22
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Come to rub it in?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/30/s/0 willi_work/willi_love/0/g-2/c-9/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/31/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Rub what in?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "No?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "This was gonna be my big chance to prove myself."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "This was gonna be the job that changed everything."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "And then Valdivian decides that AI is the wave of the future, and why do we need anyone working these jobs at all?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "And YOU, large-brained genius that you are, TRAIN my REPLACEMENT."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I lost my job too..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-0/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't even know who you are."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-0/37/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I would never do that."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Am I supposed to feel sorry for you, traitor? Because I don't."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Insult to injury, wow."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Oh you're bad enough to get me fired but not bad enough to glory in my downfall, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/15
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Yeah right."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Well, whatever. We're both in the same boat now."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Valdivian has no use for either of us, and you got me into this mess, so you're gonna be here to get me out of it."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-1/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But I-"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-1/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds goo-"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-1/18/s/0 willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/29/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I didn't-"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Time's wasting. Let's start over, shall we?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Icebreaker—your name and a fun fact."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Name's Wilhelmina Work. Friends call me Willi."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-2/27
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "You and I aren't friends, but in the spirit of team-building you can call me Willi."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-2/35
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "As for my fun fact—I speak 6 languages and am fluent in 4."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-2/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's really cool."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-2/44/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What languages are those?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-2/45/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's not all that fun a fact, is it?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Thank you. Now you."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "What, so you can tell your little AI pal how exactly to replace me?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/15
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Nice try."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I wasn't-"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Moving on."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-2/c-11/11
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Fun facts don't actually have to be fun—in fact, they shouldn't be anything too distracting or unprofessional."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-2/c-11/19
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "But I guess you wouldn't know that, would you."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-3/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Introduce yourself similarly</i>"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-3/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not doing all that."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-3/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Couldn't I just tell you my name?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-3/c-13/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I'm running this meeting, not you. Try again."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-3/c-14/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Maybe that's how you guys do things down in your little 'stealing people's jobs' department, but around here we have procedure."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-3/c-14/15
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Name and a fun fact. Go."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-3/c-14/23/b/1
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Fact may or may not be fun, up to your sole discretion."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You introduce yourself to Willi, but when it comes time for your fun fact you hesitate for a moment. What to choose?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-4/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I climbed Mount Everest with nothing but my bare hands and a dream."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-4/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I hold the world record for Candy Crash level 34-a."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-4/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I once earned a pizza party for my first grade class by reading 100 books in a year."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-4/c-15/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "That's a goddamn lie, but hey! A fun enough fact."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-4/c-16/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Ugh. I guess that's a fun fact... though the word fun is doing a lot of heavy lifting there."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-4/c-17/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I probably would have gone with something more recent, but that is heartwarming and relatable."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-4/c-17/21
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Shows initiative and ambition, too. Well done."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Well, that's done now... let's see what else is on the agenda for today."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Willi pulls her phone out, scanning through some unseen document. She frowns, her pretty features twisting into an annoyed grimace."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-5/16
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Guess we're onto scope now."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-5/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Scope?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-5/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not sure if I'm comfortable being an agenda item."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-5/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Good idea—we should define the terms of our relationship and set a plan."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-5/c-18/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Scope—wherein we'll decide the scale, parameters, and ambition of this project."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-5/c-18/21
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Good practice to ask when you don't know what something means."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-5/c-19/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I didn't ask what you were comfortable with—you got us into this and I'm gonna get us out."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-5/c-19/21
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "And we're gonna do that in the most efficient way possible—which means yes, we're gonna have agenda items and meetings."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-5/c-20/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Very good. Maybe you're not as hopeless as I thought."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-6/0
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Here's the deal: I had a job. You cost me that job."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-6/8
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I <i>AM</i> your job, so you don't have a job either."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-6/16
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Tables turning etc., etc."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-6/24
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "So you and I are going to meet every day until we figure out where I'm landing next."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-6/32
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Since this is YOUR fault, and you have nothing better to do, you owe it to me to be here for this."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-6/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What the hell do you need me for?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-6/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I didn't know I was doing it..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-6/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I appreciate the opportunity to make this right."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-6/c-21/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Did you not just hear me?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-6/c-21/21
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "You messed this up for both of us. I'm your work."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-6/c-21/29
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Therefore you need to be there to un-mess it up."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-6/c-22/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "When has that excuse ever worked? You did it, we're out of a job, now you have to deal with this."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-6/c-23/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Good. You get this straightened out and I might develop some respect for you."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-7/0
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I've got some interviews lined up with some places around the house."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-7/11
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "First one's with Hanks Ltd."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-7/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hanks Ltd.? Like the hanger Hanks?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-7/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "With who?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-7/c-24/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "The very same."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-7/c-25/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Hangers in your bedroom closet, those Hanks."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-7/c-25/18
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Do a little research before you show up so you don't embarrass us."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-7/c-25/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Am I supposed to google my own household items?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-7/c-25/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Figure it out."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/first_encounter/0/g-8/0
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Meeting adjourned."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "As you enter your office, you're surprised to find it much more crowded than you're used to. Willi is standing in front of a group of five men in jumpsuits, and they seem to be scrutinizing her almost as much as she is them."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/14
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "There you are. We went ahead and started without you."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/43
msgctxt "Hanks"
msgid "PRAISE BE TO THE LORD OF SPEED, A BUFFER!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/66
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "What was that?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/77
msgctxt "Hanks"
msgid "UH... RIGHT ON, NEW HOMIE! WE'RE HAVING A GREAT TIME RIDIN' THE RIPPIN' THERMALS OF BUSINESS AND RAD CORPORATE LINGO!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/100
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Please, let's keep it professional. You're at a 10 right now and I'm gonna need you at a 3."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/108
msgctxt "Hank 3"
msgid "I'm 3!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/116
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Quiet down!!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/127
msgctxt "Hanks"
msgid "Y-yes homie... Or ma-ma'am."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/150
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Extreme sports and working in the corporate world are essentially the same so there's no doubt in my mind that I can handle this."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/158
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "But I need to know if Hanks Ltd. is ready to expand right now."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/166
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "What sort of time are you all putting in? What are your typical office hours?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/174
msgctxt "Hank 1"
msgid "Big thrills don't have office hours, dawg!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/182
msgctxt "Hank 4"
msgid "We hit it hard when the waves are right and the thermals are doin' their thing!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/190
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Mmm..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/198
msgctxt "Hank 3"
msgid "... what are you writing?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/206
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "...inconsistent... hours..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/232 willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-0/c-5/31/c-0/7 willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-8/23/c-0/31/c-1/7 willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-9/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I see."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/240
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "You."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/248
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Willi turns towards you, and the Hanks all look at you with a sort of desperation in their gaze, silently pleading with you to save them."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/271/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What sort of benefits package do you all offer?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/272/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't think this is a fit, Willi."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/273/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Could you share your mission statement with us?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/c-0/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Nice. A bit early in the interview, but an important consideration."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/c-0/21
msgctxt "Hank 2"
msgid "The only benefit we offer is the full body thrill of conquering your fears and living extreme, bro!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/c-0/29
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Not exactly what I'd call a competitive offer..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/c-0/37
msgctxt "Hank 5"
msgid "Competition ain't our thing, homie-ma'am! That just ain't what we're about!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Please hold your analysis until after the interview. That's just basic courtesy."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/c-2/13
msgctxt "Hank 1"
msgid "Mission statement? This is getting to be way too much, man."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Hank 2"
msgid "We welcome anyone with an open mind and a radical spirit."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Hank 3"
msgid "And if you ever wanna come hang out, you're welcome!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Hank 4"
msgid "But THIS is officially over the line, dude."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Hank 5"
msgid "We ain't no corporation, homie! We're just a bunch of Hanks tryin' to grab the bull by the horns and ride that bucking bronco into the sunset!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "You're mixing three different metaphors there, but point taken. You can leave."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-0/40
msgctxt "Hanks"
msgid "Hanks OUT!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-0/66
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The Hanks leave your office swiftly, taking their cheerful, awkward energy with them. Willi sighs, shaking her head."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-0/96
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Well that was pointless."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-0/104
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Another potential gig down the drain."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-0/112/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't think it was a good fit, honestly."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-0/113/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Were you really hopeful about those guys?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-0/114/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "There's no way a priss like you was gonna be hang gliding."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I mean, maybe it wasn't—but hell, I don't know..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-0/c-4/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Maybe not about those guys, but you know... you never know which way life is going to take you."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Maybe YOU wouldn't have. Don't project that onto me."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Don't you ever wonder about the jobs you could have had?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "The person you could have been if you didn't throw it all down the drain time after time?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "All my life I've wondered about my potential... what I could have achieved if I ever stuck with something."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Watching my peers go from having a job to having a career, climbing the ladder, making something of themselves."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-1/32
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I have it in me, I know I do."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-1/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I wish I knew what that felt like."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-1/44/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I know you do, Willi. We'll find something for you."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-1/45/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Delusion will take you far in the corporate world."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I mean you SHOULD know what it feels like. I'm only here because of you!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/21
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "We're never going to get a job with that kind of bum attitude."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "And you too. Don't think you're getting out of this."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/21
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "But I appreciate it."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "What would you know about that? You've never done ANYTHING of note in the corporate world."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/21
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I'm not taking that from someone whose last job title was AI coach."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/29/c-0/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Bup bup bup. Nice try. Moving on now."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-2/3
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Alright, extreme sports was not a fit."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-2/11
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I can see that now, but that doesn't mean we can't explore the athletic space."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-2/19
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I've got a Duncan Shuttlecock scheduled to come in next to talk sports."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-2/30
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "So maybe we're not the hang-gliding type... maybe we do yoga instead."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-2/38
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Maybe we throw a football around."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-2/46
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Startups pivot all the time, right?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-2/54
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "We just have to be agile... flexible..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-2/62/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Harder... better... faster..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-2/63/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't want to disappoint you but I have never been all that athletic..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-2/64/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can't wait to watch you flub that one too."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Exactly. Exactly."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/21
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "We've been sitting around on our asses long enough. Time to PIVOT!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "So what? Plenty of people pick up sports and exercise later in life."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/21
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I mean, how the hell are we supposed to know what our 'thing' is if you keep dismissing it out of hand?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-2/c-11/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I'm gonna need you to adjust your goddamn loser attitude ASAP."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-2/c-11/21
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "We're supposed to be on the same page here and those kinds of comments just throw us out of alignment every single time."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Meet me back here and come ready to talk SPORTS."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "We're gonna take Duncan and his sports empire elevator all the way to the top, honey."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/second_encounter/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "And again, don't be late."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/10
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "To your relief, when you enter the office this time, Willi is not already mid-interview."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/18
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "There you are."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/26/b/1
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "My steady right hand!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/27/b/1
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Hope you’re prepared for this interview."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/28/b/1
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I'm honestly amazed you showed up, but whatever."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/31
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "You're right on time."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/39
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Unfortunately Mr. Shuttlecock is late."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/47/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah. If you're not early to an interview you're late."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Isn't this when you told us to meet?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Another flubbed interview huh? But hey, it's not your fault this time!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/c-0/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Exactly. Perhaps Mr. Shuttlecock doesn't consider us worth his time."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "It is. But interview etiquette dictates you arrive a little early."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/c-1/21
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Makes a good impression after all."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/c-2/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "It wasn't my fault last time either, but thanks for that unasked for feedback."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/c-2/21
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "You really are <i>not</i> a team player, are you?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The sound of airhorns shatters the very thoughts in your mind. Before you can speak, someone is bursting into the room, bringing an atmosphere of chaos that overwhelms you both."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/20
msgctxt "Dunk"
msgid "NOW ENTERING THE STADIUM... THE HOMETOWN HERO... EVERYONE'S PAL... YOUR AND MY FAVORITE... NUMBER 17... MR... DUNCAN... \"DUNK\"... SHUTTLECOOOOCK!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/31
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "You're late."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/42
msgctxt "Dunk"
msgid "I am? Shit, my bad, my bad y'all. I thought you said to come about now-"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/50
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "You're a minute late, and your little intro cost us more valuable time."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/58
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "So if you don't mind..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/66
msgctxt "Dunk"
msgid "Mm, mm, mm, yes ma'am. Yeah, yeah, sorry ma'am."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/77
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Forget about it. Just tell us about yourself."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/85
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Give us the Shuttlecock Sports elevator pitch."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/93
msgctxt "Dunk"
msgid "Elevator pitch? You mean like..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/101
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dunk very slowly mimes throwing a baseball, looking at you and Willi for confirmation that this is what you're asking of him."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/109
msgctxt "Dunk"
msgid "Shit, wait, elevator pitch. Elevator pitch. My bad."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/117
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He does the same thing, but this time he begins slowly crouching down, as if he were riding in an elevator."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/128
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Willi doesn't even say anything this time. She just stares at him in a disbelieving silence."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/139
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dunk looks back and forth between the two of you, but when he finds no clues in your stunned expressions, he simply hands you a cleat."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/150
msgctxt "Dunk"
msgid "Elevator pitch."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/158
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Oh for god's sake, just sum yourself up for us very quickly!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/169
msgctxt "Dunk"
msgid "OHHH yeah yeah, okay! I can do that!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/177
msgctxt "Dunk"
msgid "Okay, so check this out."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/185
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dunk flexes hard, his muscles bulging—his physique is impressive on its own, but he's really laying it on thick here."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/199
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "There are muscles in places you didn't realize muscles could be—he's truly in excellent shape."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/210
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Go on."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/218
msgctxt "Dunk"
msgid "This is it right here, baby!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/226
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "What is? Your flexing?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/234
msgctxt "Dunk"
msgid "This IS Dunk Shuttlecock! The sports equipment, the myth, the legend!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/242
msgctxt "Dunk"
msgid "All this hard muscle IS the Dunk Shuttlecock experience!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/250
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Did I give you the impression I invited you to speed dating?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/258
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I am asking you to sell me on your LIFESTYLE."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/266
msgctxt "Dunk"
msgid "Is that... not what I'm doing?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/274
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "No!!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/282
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "YOU are not the product! Please in ten words or less sum up why we should invest in the Shuttlecock experience!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/290
msgctxt "Dunk"
msgid "Oh okay, okay, okay, I got you. Alright. Uh... AHEM-EM-EM-EM."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/298
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dunk frowns, moving his lips without making any sound, counting silently on his fingers."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/309
msgctxt "Dunk"
msgid "Me... like... sports. Sports... feel... good."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/317
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He beams at the two of you, deeply pleased he managed to solve Willi's riddle."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/328
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "...incredible."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/336
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Thanks very much, Mr. Shuttlecock. We'll be in touch in the days to come."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/344
msgctxt "Dunk"
msgid "Cool, cool. You have a nice day now!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/358
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Willi puts her head in her hands, sighing long and loud."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/366
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "What the hell was that? What was <i>that</i>?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/374/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Someone living his best life."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/375/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The Duncan Shuttlecock experience, I believe."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/376/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Probably not a good fit."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Oh is he? Well good for HIM."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/21
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Really, truly, good for him!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/c-4/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Yeah, I got that."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "You're telling me!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-1/3
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "It must be real fucking nice knowing just who you are and where you're going at all times!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-1/11
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I'd love to be wandering around just shouting 'WILLI WORK' and knowing that was all I needed to make it."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-1/19
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Guy like that probably got carried through existence on the strength of his athletic ability and star athlete status."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-1/27
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I bet he came into this world with a football in one hand and a plan to get drafted to the big leagues in the other."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-1/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Star athletes have to work hard too."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-1/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Jealousy is such a bad look..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-1/37/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It can be a curse too though."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Oh please, don't start with that. I'm not trying to hear that right now."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/21
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Whether it's true or not doesn't change the fact that I have no idea what I'm doing here."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "So is unemployment, so I don't know why YOU feel qualified to judge right now."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/21
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "If you're not going to be constructive keep it to your goddamn self."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/13 willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/37/c-0/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "How?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "All the pressure and expectation... and when you don't make it to where you hoped you would..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "...guess you end up right back in the same boat with that whole wasted potential thing."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/21/c-0/15
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "...well, whatever. I'm not going to shed any tears for some spoiled athlete."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/21/c-0/23
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "But I'll grant you that maybe Mr. Shuttlecock isn't necessarily the privileged baby I assumed he was."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/21/c-0/31
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "So now that we've gotten that <i>extremely</i> important point out of the way..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Willi's gaze falls upon a paper in front of her. She scans over it briefly, and then sighs."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I've got other interviews lined up around here, but I'm wondering if it's all a waste of time."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I want this to be work, but it's not. I mean hell, look at this."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Coffee with Jean Loo?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-2/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Who?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-2/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh dear..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Count yourself lucky if you don't know... but go have a chat with your toilet sometime and you'll find out."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "What, am I gonna start a rap career at my age?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "And then this, lunch with Scandalabra..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-3/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Excuse me?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-3/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I wouldn't wish that on anyone."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-3/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I might be a bigger freak than he is."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-3/c-11/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Candelabra. Total freak but knows everything about everyone."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-3/c-13/15
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Perhaps I underestimated you..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I mean I figured maybe he had his... well, candelabras don't have ears... his candle holes? To the ground?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "God, I'm really scraping the bottom of the barrel here. But I have to try..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-4/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think you're pushing yourself too hard."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-4/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Effort solely for the sake of feeling productive isn't actually productive <i>or</i> healthy."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-4/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just do what I do and embrace oblivion and bumhood."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-4/c-14/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Well why shouldn't I? How else am I ever going to turn my life around?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-4/c-14/21
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Maybe if you pushed yourself harder neither of us would be here now."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-4/c-15/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Oh look at you, the big productivity expert all of a sudden!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-4/c-15/21
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Of COURSE it's productive to perform productivity!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-4/c-15/29
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "And productivity is healthy, ergo performing productivity is healthy!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-4/c-15/40/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uhhh..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-4/c-15/40/c-0/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Trust me, the math maths there. I know what I'm talking about."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-4/c-16/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "NO!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-4/c-16/24
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I don't ever want to hear you say some defeatist shit like that again, you hear me?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-4/c-16/32
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Get it out of your lexicon right now."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-4/c-16/40/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I guess..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-4/c-16/40/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Over my dead body."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-4/c-16/40/c-1/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I'm serious. I do NOT want to hear that again."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Well... I guess I gotta prepare for my next interview. I don't even know what I'm going to do yet, but..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Just meet me back here later."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-5/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Alright."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-5/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We'll see."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/third_encounter/0/g-5/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "See you then."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "As you enter the office, an aristocrat in a powdered wig rushes past you—he seems quite offended. Your eyes meet briefly, but he doesn't bother to speak to you. An air of great offense permeates his being."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/17
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Willi has her arms folded across her chest, tension evident in both her posture and her expression."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What happened there?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Lover's spat?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/27/s/0 willi_work/willi_hate/0/83/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you alright?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Oh I'll tell you what happened!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Never, not in a million years, not if he was the last goddamn light source on earth!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/c-2/7 willi_work/willi_hate/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Me? Oh I'm FINE."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "He isn't, though."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Do you know that creep had the nerve to tell me that he knows EVERYTHING that happens in this house?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "All the best job opportunities, all the best ways to ace an interview!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/g-0/19
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "And that he'd share it with me for the price of a single kiss?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/g-0/27
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "And then, when I told him he was out of his goddamn mind, he said..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/g-0/35
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "'Well then, at least dinner!'"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/g-0/43
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "'Come now, my dear! You cannot have something for nothing, you know? Hmph!'"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/g-0/51/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds hot."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/g-0/52/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I hope you slapped him."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/g-0/53/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What an asshole!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "What the hell is wrong with you?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/24
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "You know what, no. Don't answer that. We don't have time to get into THAT laundry list of problems."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/32
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Anyway, I slapped the gold plating right off him."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/g-0/c-4/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I sure did!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/g-0/c-4/24
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "For some reason, he didn't like it..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/13 willi_work/willi_love/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Right?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/21
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "So anyway I slapped him."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "He got his wicks in a twist after that and left."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I didn't even get any leads out of him before he tried to pull that vile shit on me."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "So now I wasted my time AND my hand kinda hurts."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe this is a sign..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You still checked something off of your to do list. That's progress, right?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Serves you right for slapping him."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "A sign for what?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe it's time to try something different..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Like what? Really, what else can I do?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I mean, in the most bare minimum technical sense, sure."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/15
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "But I'm not really going for 'technically complete'."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/23
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I need to <i>actually</i> be employed."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Are you seriously taking his side on this?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/15
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I have half a mind to tell you to just leave right now but I'm just so over it all..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "God, whatever. Look."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I'm tired of being the one doing all the work."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "YOU trained our replacement. The whole point of you being here with me was to help me fix this."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "So go on. Your turn now."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/32
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "You contribute something to this employment journey."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What if we just had a spa day today?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe it's time to consider a life of crime."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe we could start a business..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_spa/0/10
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "A spa day? With what money?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_spa/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We can just run the shower and stick our heads in the steam for a bit."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_spa/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_spa/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I might have some cucumber in the kitchen... some drinks in the fridge... come on, use your imagination."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_spa/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Well... it does sound kind of relaxing... and sweet... if a little cheap."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_spa/0/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Hell, why not. Let's have a budget spa day."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_spa/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's do it!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_spa/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually I have this cucumber right here..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_spa/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "How... old is that?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_spa/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-1/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Old enough..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_spa/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-1/21/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're right. Bad call."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_spa/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-1/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Ditch the cuke and it's a deal."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_spa/0/g-0/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Willi is reluctant at first, but she allows you to give her a facial of sorts with the skincare products you find around your bathroom. She does complain a bit."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_spa/0/g-0/14/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "As you lay your clumsily-sliced cucumber over her eyes, however, you finally see her starting to relax."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_spa/0/g-0/15/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "As you light the incense over the sink, however, you can see her starting to relax for the first time."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_spa/0/g-0/18
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She smiles in a way you've not seen before—and for a moment you wonder if perhaps she might be finally letting go; just for a little while."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_spa/0/g-0/26
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "... well, I gotta hand it to you."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_spa/0/g-0/34
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "It wasn't the best treatment I've ever had, but hanging out with you wasn't bad."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_spa/0/g-0/42
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I'm still not employed, but I do feel a little better."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_spa/0/g-0/53
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "So thanks."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_spa/0/g-0/61/s/0 willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-1/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're welcome."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_spa/0/g-0/62/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm glad you enjoyed it."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_spa/0/g-0/63/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wasn't bad? Will it kill you to be nice?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_spa/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I AM being nice!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_spa/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Don't ruin the good vibes we just spent all that time cultivating!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_spa/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Maybe slowing down every now and again isn't such a bad idea."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_spa/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I'm gonna take a nap and see if anything comes to me after that."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_spa/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "See you later."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_spa/0/g-1/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sleep well."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_spa/0/g-1/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "See ya."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_spa/0/g-1/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds good."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_crime/0/0
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Do you hear yourself? A life of crime?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_crime/0/8
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "What exactly are we supposed to do? Rob a bank?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_crime/0/16
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Scam the elderly out of their life savings over the phone?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_crime/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I hear that last one does make you a lot of money..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_crime/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You can't spell 'wire fraud' without 'we'."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_crime/0/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're the big genius here, not me. You figure it out."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_crime/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Yeah, and it also gets you years in federal prison."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_crime/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Aside from the fact that you're robbing the elderly you <i>fucking monster</i>."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_crime/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I get what you're saying, but actually you can!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_crime/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Or here, let me put it in a way you'll understand:"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_crime/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "You CAN spell wire fraud without 'ME'."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_crime/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Uh... I mean, I am, yeah."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_crime/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "But this whole life of crime thing was YOUR suggestion."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_crime/0/c-2/23
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Don't throw out an idea if you don't actually know what it is you're saying."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_crime/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "God, why are we even talking about this?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_crime/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I am not that desperate and also this is idiotic."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_crime/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I thought maybe I was done doing all the work here, but if this is the level of ideas you're bringing to the table..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_crime/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Guess I'll be in charge of the entire thing as per usual."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_crime/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "So, just to be clear, NO crime."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_crime/0/g-0/40
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "You are coming back here and I, Willi, will fix this like I always do."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_crime/0/g-0/48
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Her shoulders sag just a little."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_crime/0/g-0/56
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Like I always fucking do."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_business/0/0
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "You think we should start a business? Do you have any idea what that takes?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_business/0/8
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "First of all, we don't even have a business idea."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_business/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow, assumptions!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_business/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes I do."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_business/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, do you?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_business/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Oh you DO have an idea?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_business/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I do!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_business/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Oh yeah?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_business/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I'm not the one on trial here."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_business/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Go on then, let's hear it. Give me the million-dollar small business idea."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_business/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We form our own indie game studio."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_business/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We found a software company to compete with Valdivian."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_business/0/g-0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We just need to find a few suckers, and then THOSE guys find a few suckers, and then..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_business/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Willi stares at you in complete silence for a few moments, and then she bursts out laughing, doubling over as tears stream down her cheeks."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_business/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "HA! HAHAHAHA! YOU THINK... YOU THINK..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_business/0/g-0/c-3/26
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "YOU THINK THAT'S... GONNA MAKE YOU MONEY?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_business/0/g-0/c-3/34
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "WAHAHAHA!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_business/0/g-0/c-3/45
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It takes just a little too long for Willi to compose herself, but when she does she grows serious once again."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_business/0/g-0/c-3/53
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Making games is about the riskiest proposition you can imagine."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_business/0/g-0/c-3/61
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "And we are NOT in a position to even consider doing something like that."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_business/0/g-0/c-3/69
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "We don't have the skills, time, or funding to make anything worthwhile, and even if we did..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_business/0/g-0/c-3/77
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "We could STILL find ourselves launching to zero sales and losing it all."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_business/0/g-0/c-3/85
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "No, no, and NO."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_business/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Are you insane?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_business/0/g-0/c-4/15
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Founding a software company alone would be a nightmare."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_business/0/g-0/c-4/23
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "You think you and I are gonna take on Valdivian!?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_business/0/g-0/c-4/31
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "We could get funding and make hundreds of millions of dollars and STILL never come close to touching Valdivian!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_business/0/g-0/c-4/39
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "And frankly with all this AI bullshit I have no interest in doing anything remotely close to Valdivian."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_business/0/g-0/c-4/47
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Just no."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_business/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "You sound like you're about to try and sell me on a multi-level marketing scam."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_business/0/g-0/c-5/15
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "And if this is all you had prepared I'm gonna need you to just turn around and walk out of this office right now."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_business/0/g-0/c-5/23
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I might be unemployed, but I am not THAT unemployed. We can do better."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_business/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Willi pinches the bridge of her nose between her fingers, closing her eyes."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_business/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Today has been way too much—I'm getting a headache."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_business/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I can't believe I'm saying this, but I need a break."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_business/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Come back later, alright? I need to decompress."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_business/0/g-1/32
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "We'll circle back to this some other time."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_business/0/g-1/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Alright..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_business/0/g-1/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "See you."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Willi looks positively defeated today, her impressive height reduced to a despondent hunch as she cradles her head in her hands. Her pretty face is wreathed in sadness."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/14/b/1
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Oh, thank goodness it's you..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/15/b/1
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "...oh. Hey..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/16/b/1
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "...you would show up right now. Whatever."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/19
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She shakes her head, absorbed in her own worries once more."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/27
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "It's everywhere... there's really no beating this is there?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/35
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "What's the point... what is the goddamn point?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/44/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey, are you okay?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/45/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You finally snap?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/c-0/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Everything."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I'm really not."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/c-2/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Yeah, maybe I have."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Company after company is banking their entire strategy on AI."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Doesn't matter what your company actually does, or if AI has any real application in that field."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Investors LOVE AI, so everyone's just going full speed ahead into AI this and that."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "What the hell does work even look like going forward?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "There's gonna be two jobs left in this world, and both of them are gonna be sitting in front of a monitor and making sure an AI is doing its job right."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-0/40
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "What the hell does work look like in a world like this?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-0/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I wish I knew."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-0/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We don't have to accept that."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-0/50/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Accepting our AI overlords and falling in line."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Me too."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/21
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Maybe I'm just fighting against time."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/29
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "But it just feels so unfair."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-0/c-4/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Don't we? I mean, it feels like we're the only ones who aren't."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Is that seriously all we have left?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I know I'm the last one to speak on what it means to be human..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "But what does it even mean to be human in a workplace that's so ready to toss you out like yesterday's garbage?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "How does the abstract concept of work even continue to exist without humanity in the workforce?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "If you're replaced by AI... what happens to me?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow, way to make this all about you."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's never going to happen, Willi."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe we redefine what it is to work."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I'm not! I was just... I just wanted to know..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/21
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Why did I think I was going to get any sympathy from you?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/29
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "You're HAPPY wasting your life doing nothing."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/37
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "You don't give a single shit if anything changes here."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/45/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's not true."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/45/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, I just don't give a shit about you."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/45/c-0/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Don't try to pretend otherwise."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/45/c-0/15
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "You were really clear just now... so I have nothing more to say to you."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/45/c-0/27
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Thank you for your services. Wishing you the best in your career."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/45/c-0/35
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Clean out your desk. We're done."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/45/c-1/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Go away. I can't even look at you."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/45/c-1/15
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "You're just another cog in the machine."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/45/c-1/23
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "This was never going to work... I should have known better."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/45/c-1/35
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "...thank you for your services. Wishing you the best in your career."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I wish I could be as confident as you."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/21
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Look around us. Every single field, every company is weighing or has already added AI to their workflow."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/29
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "It doesn't matter how much money it loses them, or how bad the work is. Doesn't that feel... inevitable?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/37/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It doesn't have to be inevitable. We can still push back."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/37/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe it is, maybe it isn't. No reason to give up hope."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/37/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We organize. Collective action is the only way we can ever match the power of these big corporations."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/37/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I... yeah, you're right."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/37/c-1/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "...I hope you're right. Just feels hard to hold onto anything positive in the face of all this."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe AI is the future, maybe not. If AI truly is inevitable, then maybe we redefine our relationship to work."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "But how?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/21/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's never been healthy or feasible to define our value by the work we do in a capitalistic society."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/21/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Yeah, but it IS a reality we can't change."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/21/c-0/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe we can't take down capitalism on our own, but we can refuse to let it beat us."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/21/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If this is a mistake these huge companies are insistent on making, then fine, but we're not going to let it kill our spirit."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/21/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/21/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sooner or later the massive amount of money these companies are hemorrhaging chasing the latest corporate fad will take its toll."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/21/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "And before that happens we fight for our rights and make sure they don't go getting any ideas like that again?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/21/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Exactly. We can't control the future, but we can organize and ensure that future generations don't go through this kind of thing."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/21/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "...you make it sound so easy."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/21/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It isn't. I know it isn't. But we have to try."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/21/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I'm embarrassed you had to see me like this."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "But I'm grateful you heard me out."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "...need to be alone for a little while. I don't really know what's next."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I just need some time."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-2/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I understand."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/fifth_encounter/0/g-2/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "See you later."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/0 willi_work/willi_friend/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When you enter your office Willi seems more clear-headed than when you'd last spoken. She seems..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Happy?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey Willi."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You look better."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Heyyyy."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Oh hey, there you are!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I was just getting ready to ping you... it's like you read my mind."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I still don't have a job yet. Or a plan."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I thought you were going to tell me some good news..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Then why do you seem so happy?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-0/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh hey, me too."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I am! Just listen."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Well, I've been thinking..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "That's okay."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I mean... sure, you trained my replacement and we got fired."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "But maybe this was supposed to happen."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "If the future is that uncertain... if me and all my potential can just come in and get kneecapped by some insane unforeseen development like AI all over the place..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Maybe it's time to stop worrying about what I COULD be, what I COULD have done."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-1/32
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "And just worry about who Willi is now. What makes me happy."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-1/40
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I mean, it doesn't pay my bills, that's for sure, but..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-1/48
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Then again, that's kinda your problem, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-1/56
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "And what could be more corporate than making the bill somebody else's responsibility, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-1/64
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "In a way, I'm actually sort of killing it at this whole corporate job thing when you really think about it."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-1/72/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So the lesson you learned is 'who cares, it's not my problem'?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-1/73/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Now you're thinking positively."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-1/74/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well that's... one way out of this mess."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-1/c-6/7 willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Exactly!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "It is, and that's the way I'm taking."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "There's something else I need to say to you. And it's not going to be easy."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-2/8 willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I... was not the kindest to you."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-2/16 willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Maybe I was even unkind to you."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-2/24 willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I get that you didn't know you were training the AI that took our jobs. It could have happened to anyone."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-2/32 willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "It just felt... easier to be mad at you, when I was really just mad at myself for once again doing nothing with my life."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-2/40 willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/32
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "But you kept coming back, and you kept backing me up. And that really... really means a lot."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-2/48 willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/40
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "So maybe we're both unemployed. But..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-2/56
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Being unemployed leaves you a lot of time to get back to the things that interest you. The things that really matter in life."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-2/64
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Willi looks at you from beneath her long lashes, a coy smile playing on her lips."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-2/72
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "You and I make a good team, don't we? We're just so... synergetic."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-2/80/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What are you saying?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-2/81/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I love you too."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-2/82/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't like the sound of that."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "We're just in such perfect alignment."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-2/c-10/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Shhhh. Don't make it weird."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-2/c-11/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Let me rephrase."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Look, this isn't some love confession, but... I'm into you, alright?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Frankly I don't know how you ignored the sexual tension flying between us every time we spoke."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I did it because I'm a consummate professional, but I don't know how the hell you managed."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-3/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It was hard. Very hard."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-3/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well I just wanted to be friends, so..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-3/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Eww, gross. No thanks."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-3/c-12/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Oh yeah? How hard was it?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-3/c-12/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It was the greatest test of my professionalism in my entire career."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-3/c-12/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Ooooohohoho..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-3/c-12/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Tell me more."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-3/c-12/15/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Every time you spoke I was expecting HR to burst in and discipline me."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-3/c-12/15/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Oh you are <i>sick</i>."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-3/c-12/15/c-0/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "You're just my type, aren't you."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-3/c-13/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Oh. Well..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-3/c-13/15
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I have had fun hanging out with you, so it would be nice to keep that up."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-3/c-13/23
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I'll need a little time to pivot and regroup, but I can manage that."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-3/c-13/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm glad... I enjoy our friendship, Willi."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-3/c-13/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "So do I! Next time we hang out we'll be on the same page, I promise."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-3/c-14/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Wha- Are you kidding me right now?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-3/c-14/15
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "After everything we've shared all you can give me is 'eww, gross'? 'NO THANKS'???"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-3/c-14/23
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I don't know how I didn't see this coming. It's like getting fired all over again."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-3/c-14/31
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Unused potential, my only constant companion. My life is a goddamn joke!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-3/c-14/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not my problem."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-3/c-14/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sorry, Willi."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I don't wanna hear shit else from you!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Consider this your termination notice."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love/0/g-4/16
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "... asshole."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_flirt/0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd like to think so."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_flirt/0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Only one way to find out."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_flirt/0/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "And you're just my type."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_flirt/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Willi looks at you with an entirely unprofessional gaze, her brown eyes radiating a very specific sort of intention."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_flirt/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Well I have nothing else on the agenda for today..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_flirt/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "What do you say we go touch base?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_flirt/0/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can we just take it easy for now?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_flirt/0/g-0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm gonna touch your base like it's never been touched before, baby."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_flirt/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Hey, of course. I just want to spend some time with you."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_flirt/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Maybe we could have another spa day..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_flirt/0/g-0/c-3/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd like that."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_flirt/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You spend a lovely time together just relaxing and giving each other very, VERY cheap makeshift facials. The activity itself is enjoyable enough, but nothing beats seeing the contented smile on Willi's face when she looks at you."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_flirt/0/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You may be unemployed, but at least you're both happier than you've been in a long, long time."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_flirt/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Unng... you know just how to talk to an abstract representation of work, don't you."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_flirt/0/g-0/c-4/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Willi can't keep her hands off you—by the time the two of you are done, you have definitely ramped up your efforts on this project. But more than that, you have Synergized. You haven't felt <i>this</i> on the same page with a team member... well, ever."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Energized?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/19
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "It's all so simple!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/27
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I was so stressed out about losing my job before I'd even had the chance to prove myself."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/35
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "It was making me nuts, you know. Story of my life etcetera etcetera."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/43
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "But I was looking at this all wrong!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/51/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh yeah?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/52/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How so?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/53/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This ought to be good."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Yeah!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "It will be..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Look, I've been trying to hold down a job my entire life."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Have I always been successful? Obviously not, but..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I never let myself enjoy not having a job."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Because I was always so stressed out about the next thing and living up to my potential."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "So what if I'm not employed? I can be later."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-0/40
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I can always change that. But this is a chance for me to relax."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-0/48
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "For me to focus on the things I like."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-0/56/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "For you to put the 'fun' in 'funemployment'."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-0/57/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I love that for you."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-0/58/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "God this is just so sad."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "And hey..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Thank you. You're always so damn supportive."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Are you kidding me?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-0/c-5/15
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "You really can't just let me be happy?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-0/c-5/23
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "You gotta rain on my parade just because YOU'RE committed to being miserable?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-0/c-5/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Something like that, yeah."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-0/c-5/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Save it for someone who cares."
msgstr ""

