#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-0/c-5/31/c-1/31/c-1/7 willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-8/23/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/7 willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-9/23/c-1/31/c-1/7 willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-10/15/c-0/23/c-0/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Mmm you'd have to have a job to quit. Too bad."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "There's something else I need to say to you."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "...thank you."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-1/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Me? Why?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/48
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "We're in this together, aren't we?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/56/s/0 willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-9/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Of course we are."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/57/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "As friends?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/58/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Speak for yourself."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-8/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I'm so glad you agree."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-8/15
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I can't begin to tell you how important your friendship has been for me."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-8/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Only friends? Not...?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-8/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I feel the same way."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-8/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "'Not'? Not... what..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-8/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "We are ONLY friends. That is all I have to offer you."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-8/23/c-0/23
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I hope you can accept that."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-8/23/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Of course I can."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-8/23/c-0/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's all or nothing with me."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-8/23/c-0/31/c-0/7 willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-9/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Oh I'm so glad. I've really come to depend on you, you know."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-8/23/c-0/31/c-0/15 willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-8/23/c-1/15 willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-9/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Come on, let's go do something fun while we still can."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-8/23/c-0/31/c-0/23 willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-8/23/c-1/23 willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-9/23/c-0/23
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Maybe we could get some coffee... or watch some tv..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-8/23/c-0/31/c-0/31 willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-8/23/c-1/31 willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-9/23/c-0/31
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "We can do anything we want anytime we want!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-8/23/c-0/31/c-0/39/0/s/0 willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-8/23/c-1/39/0/s/0 willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-9/23/c-0/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Guess we can, can't we."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-8/23/c-0/31/c-0/39/c-0/7 willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-8/23/c-1/39/c-0/7 willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-9/23/c-0/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Whatever we do, I'm just glad to be hanging out with you."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-8/23/c-0/31/c-0/39/c-0/15/0/s/0 willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-8/23/c-1/39/c-0/15/0/s/0 willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-9/23/c-0/39/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Me too..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-8/23/c-0/31/c-0/39/c-0/15/c-0/7 willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-8/23/c-1/39/c-0/15/c-0/7 willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-9/23/c-0/39/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You and Willi make the most of your time, no longer planning for interviews or business meetings, but rather enjoying time together as friends. Willi's laugh always makes you feel like you've done something amazing—you may not have a job, but you do have an incredible friend."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-8/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "God I'm so glad. I'd hate to have to lose you."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Yes, absolutely."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-9/15
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I hope we're on the same page about that?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-9/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We're really not."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-10/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "What? You don't... you haven't enjoyed our time together?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-10/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not really, no."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-10/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "...oh."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-10/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "You're really just... all that time I thought we were cool, and you just didn't care?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-10/15/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Basically."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend/0/g-2/c-10/15/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "...I see."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When you enter your office, it's clear Willi has had a breakthrough of some kind since you last spoke."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate/0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When your eyes meet, however, you get a sinking feeling in the pit of your stomach."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate/0/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It's clear that whatever is bothering her is about to become your problem."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate/0/24
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "It's all so simple. I see it now."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate/0/32
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Valdivian wasn't content to just take my job."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate/0/40
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Oh no. They sent their strongest soldier to finish me off."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate/0/48
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "They intended to truly break my spirit from top to bottom."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate/0/56
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "You take our job away, you make sure we have nothing to come back to, and then you make me miserable here at home."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate/0/64
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Well I won't let you win, you prick!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate/0/72
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "You might be annoying as shit, but you tell Valdivian I'm not going to let them win!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate/0/84/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're insane."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate/0/85/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I really thought we were cool here."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I'm ALWAYS fine."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I can take care of myself, so spare me your fake little concern."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "No, actually, I'm seeing clearly for the first time in a very long time."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I have no idea how, when I couldn't stand you right from the start."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "You are an even bigger part of the problem than I ever realized."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "And I'm done allowing you to waste my time."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I'm gonna make something of myself and I'm gonna do it without your useless help."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I'm terminating our relationship effective immediately."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Do NOT try to contact me again."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate/0/g-0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Enjoy your unemployment, bum."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate/0/g-0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "There's no one I'd rather talk to less."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate/0/g-0/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Jeeze."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "BYE!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate_joiner/34
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "You're fired."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love_return/0/0
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Hey hon! We're still on for later, right?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love_return/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually I wanted to talk to you about Realizing you."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love_return/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Snuggles and tv?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love_return/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I didn't touch your base thoroughly enough last time... gonna go for a new personal best."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love_return/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Yes!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love_return/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Hehehehe... you keep talking like that and we'll have to just go for it here and now."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love_return/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I've got a few more applications in first, but you'll come back, won't you?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love_return/0/g-0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I wouldn't miss it for the world, baby."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love_return/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Good. See you soon..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate_return/0/0
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "What the hell are you doing here?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate_return/0/8
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "SECURITY! SECURITY!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate_return/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's just put this to bed, Willi. What do you say? (USE SASS CANDY)"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate_return/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This is MY HOUSE."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate_return/0/c-0/13
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Hm..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate_return/0/c-0/21
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Alright, alright. This is VERY classy."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate_return/0/c-0/29
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I guess we can start over. Just keep it cute, alright?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate_return/0/c-0/37/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I will. I'm so glad we can be cool again."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate_return/0/c-0/37/c-0/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "God, me too. It was so awful being mad at you all the time."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate_return/0/c-0/37/c-0/15
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "See you later then?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate_return/0/c-0/37/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, definitely."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate_return/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Don't think I can't have you escorted from the premises, bum."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate_return/0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Go on and try it, I dare you."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate_return/0/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "OoooOOHHH GOD I hate you!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate_return/0/c-1/15/c-0/18
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Just LEAVE ME ALONE!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate_return/0/c-1/15/c-0/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Have fun doing nothing all day!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_hate_return/0/c-1/15/c-0/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "GOD!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend_return/0/0
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Hey you! Hope funemployment's been treatin' you well."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend_return/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh yeah, totally. Every day's a blast."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Good, good. You wanna grab a coffee later?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend_return/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually I want to talk to you about Realization."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend_return/0/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah! Maybe grab some snacks..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend_return/0/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Oh yeah, that sounds perfect."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend_return/0/c-0/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Well I'm real busy... got a whole lotta nothing I gotta get back to."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend_return/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I hear that. Take care, friend."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_friend_return/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "You too!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_realize_join/0/0
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Oh my God, really? No interview or anything?!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_realize_join/0/8
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Realization? Just like that?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_realize_join/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, I have what it takes."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_realize_join/0/26/s/0 willi_work/willi_realize_return/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, not just yet."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_realize_join/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Oh. Damn! Don't scare me like that."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_realize_join/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Just let me know when you're ACTUALLY ready."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_realize_return/0/0
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Well? You do your research? You ready to get serious now?"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_realize_return/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, I'm ready—I have what it takes."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_realize_return/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Oh for God's sake. Stop getting me all fired up for nothing!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_realize_return/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Come back when you're actually ready to do this."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_realize_begin/6/b/1
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Our first Realization is work, huh? I hope this..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_realize_begin/6/b/9
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "...works."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_realize_begin/9
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "C'mon, Willi, let's find you something to do!"
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_realize_begin/20
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The spectral energy flows through your dateviators, and what was once merely an abstract representation of your work, becomes...."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_realized/0/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Willi is just as tall and statuesque as she's always been, but the benefit of a real body makes her physical presence all the more captivating."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_realized/0/14
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She may have once been your state of employment, but she might as well have been a runway model. She is magnificent, effortlessly graceful and poised even in this moment of supreme happiness."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_realized/0/22
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "So this is what it is to be human..."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_realized/0/30
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Feels like I've finally achieved something. Like I belong now."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_realized/0/38/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You've always belonged, Willi."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_realized/0/39/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let me show you just how much you belong."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_realized/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "...I never felt like it."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_realized/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "But maybe now I will... thank you."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_realized/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Time to get out there and really find out who Willi Work is... and what she's gonna do with her life."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love_divert/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Willi's intense gaze narrows in on you, and while she remains calm and collected, it's as if the temperature of the room has risen about ten degrees."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love_divert/11
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "You know, I think you and I are long overdue for a little meeting."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love_divert/19
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "And no, this can <i>not</i> be an email."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love_divert/27
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You might have thought you and Willi were vibing before, but her humanity enables you to reach new heights of synchronicity."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love_divert/38
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Willi ensures every item on your agenda is thoroughly addressed, line by line—and when all is said and done you peak together multiple times, your hearts in perfect organization."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love_divert/46
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Willi is quite satisfied with your work, for once seeming entirely certain she's done all she set out to do."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love_divert/54
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When she leaves the next day you can tell she's nervous and excited—her future may be uncertain, but she's ready to embrace possibility."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love_join/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Willi's journey to find herself as a human is a true journey in every sense."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love_join/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She travels the world, trying out various careers and sampling the local cuisine everywhere she goes."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love_join/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You're not really certain how she's funding this journey, to be frank—when you ask, Willi only tells you not to worry about it, and that Valdivian is making good on what they owe."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love_join/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Willi eventually ends up right back where she started: at Valdivian. She is hired as a high-level consultant to repair the extensive damage caused by handing over policy decisions to VAL-9000."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love_join/32
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She works remotely, so she frequently sends you photos of herself at the beach with a laptop and a drink in hand."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love_join/40
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Could I get another one of these coconut things? Thanks, honey."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love_join/48
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "What? I'm obviously not talking to you, <i>Milton</i>. God."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love_join/56
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Just get that report to me by EOD Monday. I'd hate to have to escalate this."
msgstr ""

#: willi_work/willi_love_join/64
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She may have taken her time getting there, but you're happy to see just how fulfilled Willi is now that she's truly found her place in life."
msgstr ""
